
! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''be'u''

;__be'u__ (UI5): lack.  This word is an attitudinal, that is, it directly expresses an emotion on the part of the speaker.  This word is part of a scale; the base attitudinal word indicates that the speaker is feeling lack/need, the base word followed by cu'i indicates that the speaker is feeling presence/satisfaction, and the base word followed by nai indicates that the speaker is feeling satiation.(cf. claxu, nitcu, mansa)
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''be'u'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''be'u cu'i''

;__be'u cu'i__ (UI*5): presence.  This word is an attitudinal, that is, it directly expresses an emotion on the part of the speaker.  This word is part of a scale; the base attitudinal word indicates that the speaker is feeling lack/need, the base word followed by cu'i indicates that the speaker is feeling presence/satisfaction, and the base word followed by nai indicates that the speaker is feeling satiation.
